            "text_1": "<p><em>Wow—</em><em><strong>just wow</strong></em><em>. FloraFresh </em><em><strong>worked within 48 hours</strong></em><em> to eliminate an odor I’d been battling for months. 😍 Now I feel fresh, clean, and unstoppable. My confidence is through the roof! This is </em><em><strong>my secret weapon</strong></em><em> from here on out. If you want instant results, look no further — FloraFresh delivers.</em></p>",
