            "text_3": "<p> \"Three weeks in, and I swear my body did a <em>full refresh.</em> No more irritation, no more bad smell—just pure, all-day freshness. My confidence shot up, and let’s just say my husband is VERY thankful. 😏 FloraFresh is a game-changer!\"</p>",
