        "text_rUgXXK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What’s Happening Down There</strong><br/><br/>The vagina’s microbiome is a bustling ecosystem. Too few Lactobacillus probiotics can tip the pH toward basic, leaving room for pesky bacteria to stir up irritation or off odors.</p><p><strong>Why FloraFresh Helps</strong><br/><br/>FloraFresh Vaginal Prebiotic Probiotic packs 4 Lactobacillus strains, XOS prebiotics, D-Mannose, and Vitamin C to keep them thriving. This duo works to edge out unwanted bacteria, fostering pH harmony, soothing comfort, and a confident, healthy scent.*</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
