            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "title": "Dr. Claire Thompson, ND – Women’s Hormone Expert",
            "text": "<p>With 15 years of clinical practice in integrative women’s health, Dr. Claire uncovers the hidden imbalances that lead to unwanted odor. She laid the groundwork for FloraFresh’s powerful formulation, selecting each ingredient to promote a balanced vaginal microbiome and maintain long-lasting freshness.</p>",
