            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_31.png",
            "muted_autoplay": true,
            "title": "Rachel Nguyen, BSc – Lead Nutrition Scientist",
            "text": "<p>Rachel leverages her extensive expertise in plant-based and probiotic science to calibrate FloraFresh’s dosage for maximum efficacy. Her rigorous testing ensures every batch delivers gentle, yet fast-acting results—free from artificial additives and harsh chemicals.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
