            "title": "Elizabeth Ross, OB/GYN – 25+ Years in Women’s Health",
            "text": "<p>Dr. Ross contributes decades of clinical insight to refine FloraFresh’s blend of herbs, probiotics, and nutrients. She recognizes the importance of safe, natural support for women seeking relief from uncomfortable odors, irritation, and imbalances—so they can feel confident every day.</p>",
