    "collapsible_content_HkG9n6": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_zC6Czf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are vaginal prebiotic + probiotic?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>FloraFresh is a carefully formulated vaginal prebiotic + probiotic supplement designed to support a balanced vaginal microbiome. It contains a synergistic blend of probiotics and prebiotics to maintain optimal vaginal pH, promote healthy flora, and help manage unwanted dryness and odors naturally.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qrGA9d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does FloraFresh work?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>FloraFresh works by replenishing beneficial bacteria in the vaginal ecosystem, helping to crowd out non-beneficial microbes and support a healthy balance. The probiotic strains in FloraFresh—<strong>Lactobacillus salivarius, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus reuteri, and Lactobacillus gasseri</strong>—have been selected for their ability to promote vaginal health, while <strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) and D-Mannose</strong> provide additional support.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rmQF7P": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is a synbiotic?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>A synbiotic combines both <strong>probiotics (beneficial bacteria)</strong> and <strong>prebiotics (nutrients that help probiotics thrive)</strong> to maximize their effectiveness. FloraFresh’s <strong>probiotic blend (15 Billion CFUs)</strong> works in harmony with XOS prebiotics to create a supportive environment for vaginal wellness.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_trmaKd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I take FloraFresh with other supplements?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! FloraFresh is designed to complement other wellness supplements. It pairs well with urinary tract support formulas, PMS relief supplements, and general gut health probiotics. However, if you are taking multiple probiotic formulas, consider spacing them throughout the day for best results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Gz6jXJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I take FloraFresh?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Take <strong>2 capsules per day</strong>, preferably with food, or as directed by your healthcare provider. For best results, make FloraFresh part of your <strong>daily wellness routine</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XA6Kqd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can FloraFresh be taken with prescription medications?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>If you are taking prescription medications or have a medical condition, it's best to <strong>consult your healthcare provider</strong> before starting any new supplement. Do not use if the safety seal is broken or missing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gDKUrK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any side effects I should be concerned about with FloraFresh?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Warning: Don’t bother hauling extra menstrual pads to work! FloraFresh might hit you with a hydration wave so wild you’ll think you’re Niagara Falls down there—but relax, it’s just our probiotics and Vitamin C turning your dusty, stinky woes into a hot, fresh splash party!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_76bB7Y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take for FloraFresh to work?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Many users notice improvements within 7-14 days, with full benefits after 8 weeks of consistent use. Individual results may vary, but we're confident you'll see positive changes</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TVNFXE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can vaginal probiotics affect my menstrual cycle?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Probiotics do not directly alter menstrual cycles, but lifestyle factors, stress, and diet can contribute to cycle changes. If you experience any unusual shifts, consult your healthcare provider.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nqD9hG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the key ingredients in FloraFresh?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Each serving (2 capsules) contains:</p><ul><li><strong>Vitamin C (as Ascorbic Acid) – 40mg</strong> (44% DV)</li><li><strong>FloraFresh Probiotic Blend – 54mg</strong> (15 Billion CFUs of Lactobacillus strains)</li><li><strong>Xylooligosaccharides (Prebiotic XOS) – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>D-Mannose – 50mg</strong></li><li><strong>(Capsules are free from artificial additives, gluten, dairy, and GMOs.)</strong></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xQrpXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I track my package?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Want to know if your vitamins are on their way? Tracking information should have been sent to you via email when you placed your order. If you didn’t receive it, send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:support@wellnessnest.co\">support@wellnessnest.co</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4bAkmy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are Wellness Nest supplements FDA-approved?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>By law, the FDA does not approve dietary supplements. However, it does regulate both dietary supplements and their ingredients. At Wellness Nest, we comply with the FDA’s “Current Good Manufacturing Practice” (cGMP) regulations, established in 2007. These require manufacturers to evaluate products for identity, purity, strength, and composition. We go further by testing for stability with our manufacturers and conducting third-party testing for potency of active ingredients, as well as screening for adulterants like heavy metals and microbes, allergens, rancidity, and other unwanted contaminants.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BF8899": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any artificial flavors, colors, or dyes in Wellness Nest supplements?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Nope! Our vitamins are all-natural, made with vegan, non-GMO, and gluten-free ingredients.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rET8jK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How About Guarantee?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>MenoMate is protected by our <strong>90-Day 100% Money-Back Guarantee</strong>. If you don’t see or feel a difference in your menopausal symptoms, reach out within 90 days for a <strong>full refund—no questions asked</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
