        "text_dQP6WY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our formula is backed by rigorous clinical research. In a controlled study, male participants between 45-55 years were divided into treatment and placebo groups. The treatment group received 250mg of purified Shilajit twice daily, while the control group received an identical-looking placebo.</p><p><br/>After 90 days, comprehensive blood analysis revealed significant testosterone increases in the Shilajit group compared to no meaningful change in the placebo group. These hormonal improvements correlated directly with participants' reports of enhanced energy, libido, and overall wellbeing.</p><p><br/>This research confirms what traditional medicine has known for centuries: pure Shilajit is one of nature's most powerful male vitality enhancers.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
